# ==============================================================================
# 4. AI / MACHINE LEARNING / DATA SCIENCE
# ==============================================================================
# Note: Small datasets (like small .csv files for study) are intentionally NOT 
# ignored here so you can push them. 

# Large dataset formats (GitHub has a 100MB file limit)
*.dat
*.tfrecord
*.parquet

# Saved Models and Weights (Too large for standard Git)
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.pb
*.keras

# Training Logs (TensorBoard, Weights & Biases)
runs/
tb_logs/
tensorboard/
wandb/
mlruns/

